      "side": 1,
      "message": "sb_write returns success/failure. So, we can definitely check that. But I am worried if we keep retrying and sb_write keeps failing, then we would never continue booting. Maybe we should add a try_count (of 10 tries?) and if it doesn\u0027t help, just continue booting. At least the device would boot up on AC power. What do you think?",
